      "raw_full_hex": "0E00000003000400000000FF0E000100040000002F042E002E002E000E00000003000400000000FF0E000300000002000A00200012044B04200041043F044004300448043804320430043504420435040A003C0435043D044F043F00210020001D043E0420003F043E04470435043C0443043F0021000E000300010000000000"
